    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSite for Sale Subject to Planning Permission (Local Housing Need Restrictions Apply)\n\nPart of Folio CE12576F\nApprox. 0.21 Hectares (0.52 Acres)\n\nAn excellent opportunity to acquire a beautifully positioned residential site, ideally located opposite Eircode V95 P8PR in a highly sought-after countryside setting. This rectangular site extends to approximately 0.21 hectares (0.52 acres) and benefits from mature boundaries, including a traditional dry stone wall along the front.\n\nIdeally situated just 10 minutes from Ennis Town Centre and 5 minutes from the M18 motorway, the site offers excellent connectivity for those commuting to Ennis, Limerick, Galway, and Shannon Airport making this an ideal location for those seeking a balance between country living and easy access to amenities and services.\nFor further information please contact the office on 065 6840200. PSL002295"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Approx. 0.21 hectares (0.52 acres)</li><li> Rectangular site with excellent layout potential</li><li> Mature boundaries with traditional dry stone front wall</li><li> Attractive residential location</li><li> Water and electricity services passing the site</li><li> Just 5 minutes to the M18 motorway</li><li> Approximately 10 minutes to Ennis Town Centre</li><li> Being sold subject to planning permission</li><li> Local housing need restrictions apply</ul>"
